{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19234","headline":"和牛相公雨後寓怀见示 · 刘禹锡","name":"和牛相公雨後寓怀见示","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金火交争正抑扬，萧萧飞雨助清商。\n晓看纨扇恩情薄，夜觉纱灯刻数长。\n树上早蝉才发响，庭中百草已无光。\n当年富贵亦惆怅，何况悲翁发似霜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19234.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19234","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}